Apply after0016. Full24-slot/192-byte table, PE32/64 callback registration.
Registry v2 uses a fixed callback frame and owned guest-visible packet VM.
No ignored security attributes or arbitrary64KiB packet cap.
A failed VM release keeps its owner and does not replace a real API result.
Foreign-child and full behavioral acceptance remain separate.

